    <briefdescription>
<para>An access class for <ref refid="classllvm_1_1ilist__node" kindref="compound">ilist_node</ref> private API. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This gives access to the private parts of ilist nodes. Nodes for an ilist should friend this class if they inherit privately from <ref refid="classllvm_1_1ilist__node" kindref="compound">ilist_node</ref>.</para>
<para>Using this class outside of the ilist implementation is unsupported. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
